tidalt (4.0.3-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fix Daily Mixes returning a 404 after Tidal removed the v2
    userRecommendations API; the mix list and mix tracks now come from the v1
    API, which also removes a per-track request fan-out.
  * Clear stale Kitty cover-art placements on terminal resize.
  * Bump the bundled static FFmpeg to 7.1.5 and drop the sudo requirement from
    the build.

 -- Benehiko <https://github.com/Benehiko>  Wed, 09 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000

tidalt (4.0.2-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fix silent playback on fixed-format USB audio interfaces (e.g. Focusrite
    Vocaster) by falling back to plughw: when format negotiation is refused.
  * Fix a crash and playback-loop overlap when reacquiring the ALSA device
    fails, and stop play/pause inverting after a failed resume.

 -- Benehiko <https://github.com/Benehiko>  Fri, 07 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000

